{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a898cf1b-bde8-8cc8-bce1-5d01bbe77292",
  "created_at": "2025-12-22T11:30:33-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nicholas Iannuccilli",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:27:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:27:56-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi, good morning. Um, hold on, let me put this down. Okay. I'm calling about a catch basin, the storm drain on the corner, it's totally clogged up with leaves."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:28:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. What's the address, or the nearest one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:28:12-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's eleven Harrison Avenue, the Fort Adams side. I'm calling for my mother, it's her corner. And, um, it's been like this since last Monday. A whole week. Leaves just packed in the grate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:28:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And is it backing up into the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:28:29-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's the thing, there's no storm, it hasn't rained in days, and there's still a big puddle sitting there that never drains. It just sits. And now, hang on [pause] sorry, I've got the, the box of, anyway. Now the water's creeping down toward the neighbor's garage. It's running right along the edge of the driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:28:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, so it's heading for the garage door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:28:54-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's getting close. I figured somebody would've come by now, you know? A week of a puddle for no reason. It's just leaves. Somebody with a rake and a truck could, could fix it in ten minutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:29:08-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'll put in a work order for a crew to clear that basin, and I'll note the water moving toward the neighbor's garage so it gets looked at sooner. Can I get a name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:29:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nicholas Iannuccilli. Two N's, no, one N, two C's, no wait. I-A-N-N-U-C-C-I-L-I. Sorry, I'm, there's tape all over, I'm wrapping stuff."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:29:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I've got it. Do you want a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:29:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-eight. And can you call me back when it's done? Just so I know somebody actually showed up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:29:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll make a note to have someone call you once the crew has cleared it. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-eight, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:29:52-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Hey, Denise, right? My cousin's named Denise. Same exact name. She'd, she'd have had that drain cleared by now, I'll tell you that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:30:02-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'll do my best to live up to her. The order's going in right now, and it's marked for the leaves and the runoff by the garage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:30:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good. I appreciate it. I just don't want it freezing over there either, with my mother walking out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:30:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood, I put that in the note too. Anything else I can do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:30:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks. Talk to you when it's done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:30:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it, Nicholas. Take care."
    }
  ],
